[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15542.469, "timestamp": "04:19:02", "text": "是的，我觉得只有我一个人这么想。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15544.229, "timestamp": "04:19:04", "text": "现在可以在Billy Billy上观看。我是说，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15546.11, "timestamp": "04:19:06", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15549.349, "timestamp": "04:19:09", "text": "哦，没有人会来找比利比利。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15553.67, "timestamp": "04:19:13", "text": "女人就像是“是啊”。中国很可怕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15556.63, "timestamp": "04:19:16", "text": "是的。是的。确切地。我觉得不是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15559.11, "timestamp": "04:19:19", "text": "印度人，我的意思是任何人都会来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15561.55, "timestamp": "04:19:21", "text": "除了印度人，兄弟。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15565.349, "timestamp": "04:19:25", "text": "上帝。我的天啊。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15566.71, "timestamp": "04:19:26", "text": "幸好，我没被传染。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15569.67, "timestamp": "04:19:29", "text": "歧视，或者像仇外心理，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15574.309, "timestamp": "04:19:34", "text": "就像任何像呃那样的人一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15576.63, "timestamp": "04:19:36", "text": "粗鲁之类的。到目前为止，我还没有遇到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15577.79, "timestamp": "04:19:37", "text": "任何人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15580.71, "timestamp": "04:19:40", "text": "然而。谢天谢地。我的意思是，那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15584.07, "timestamp": "04:19:44", "text": "这是件好事。是啊，大家都像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15586.95, "timestamp": "04:19:46", "text": "说话要小心。人们将会是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15589.51, "timestamp": "04:19:49", "text": "种族主义者或者诸如此类的东西。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15591.429, "timestamp": "04:19:51", "text": "我的意思是，那部分确实如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15595.25, "timestamp": "04:19:55", "text": "尽管。是的，没错。是的。全部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15596.469, "timestamp": "04:19:56", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15598.429, "timestamp": "04:19:58", "text": "没错，我把你留在这里。"}]